@startuml Multiple_List_Participation

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #2F3B4A
skinparam RoundCorner 12
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #6b7280

' --- Color Palette ---
!define C_EMP #e6f3ff
!define C_LIST #e8f5e8

' --- Top: The structure ---
rectangle "Employee Structure\n{name, id, age_list_node, dept_list_node}" as EMP C_EMP

' --- Two target lists ---
rectangle "Age-sorted List" as AGE C_LIST
rectangle "Department List" as DEPT C_LIST

' --- Arrows to both lists ---
EMP -down-> AGE : participates via\nage_list_node
EMP -down-> DEPT : participates via\ndept_list_node

note bottom
A single structure can appear in multiple linked lists simultaneously.
Each embedded node connects it into a different logical chain.
end note

@enduml
